Tabs in monocle: with more than one window on the desktop, a row of tabs
under the bar, one for each window with its icon (winicon.diff) and title,
the focused one bright over an accent underline, as the selected tag is.
Clicking a tab focuses its window. A tab is as wide as its title, up to
tabmaxw (config.h); when they do not all fit, they share the row equally.
Upstream's tab patch without its key to change the mode, and so without
the per-monitor copies of the mode that key changed: showtab and toptab
(config.h) hold for every monitor.

